MODULE: AliasedTreeUnshieldedUsesPhysicalSignal
TARGET: AliasedTreeUnshielded
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: receiver policy is incorrectly claimed to resolve a logical alias
PERTURBS: ReceiverShrinkBatch

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.receiver = ReceiverBatch(LogicalValue(1))]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: pretend the receiver resolves the physical alias target.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.receiver = ReceiverBatch(treeVerdict[1])]
--- END
